      "source_text_sha256": "8714a7618dcfb10953b94e64cac740aa1af7cb99abbc7e6e06b435ecb6315f77",
      "translation": "“你在干什么啊，科特塞特！？\n　我们马上就要出发去奇拉姆了！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
